	"data": "Strategy Game — Specification Sheet\nVision\n\nWhat is this? A turn-based hex-grid strategy game for 2 players. Players command colored armies on a hexagonal battlefield, issuing movement orders each turn. Every 4 turns, all planned moves resolve simultaneously — conflicts erupt, territory shifts, and the map redraws. A season-based progression system tracks the war over time, with a full replay system to review how battles unfolded.\n\nWho is it for? Two friends sitting at the same computer…",
